{"id":2734,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>4月21日下午，由学生工作部主办、我院承办的以“法律文化视角下的文学名著”为主题的中北大讲堂在图书馆五层学术报告厅举行。本次讲座旨在通过阅读邂逅文字之美，感受阅读之力，养成读书习惯，让书香伴随成长。本次讲座特邀复旦大学法学院教授、博士生导师郭建教授主讲，我校各学院学生代表到场聆听学习。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MmMWfoR67nRlYMH4Q2oz-PM4CsnllgiLR9sLlUZM8l4LmC0gihFp2hmCIa0UShRM1yin1yZo7lsU4lYMmfVM7-iL49YnzGsM4-anRNDoRMFMmUsL8Q7LRrFMm74MRlJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsM4lJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6775&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/AC65F88E7C5260E4B5382E07720D9683/6473FD05/61345\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-LmGWin7U8Mlr2MHRLaL8QRnRA7MlLgZUz-bnNrRLRMVMR-0gihFp2hmCIa0nSh7LSysoSh2LmvaMNMVMzf7nN7DoR9DLN-bM77iU4vYLz6FM8VRUz-DM8rFMzCDLz98gtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDM4vigtA8pULcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6775&e=.jpg\"></p><p>讲座中，郭教授以法律文化为视角，提出读书应与作者平等、敢于剖析文本、树立独立思想。他梳理古代法律对文艺创作的制约，并以《水浒传》《金瓶梅》经典情节为例，生动解读文学名著背后的法律逻辑与文化内涵，语言生动、视角新颖。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nRQWVnNCYLRUPLHNlbnl-ZMNlsL4UgDnRUbLl7boRAVLzC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyDM1h2okyDMz9iUmCbnmAfMmM2nzU4MzfkMzCbMlUYnNWFnRGiL8LDMRTFMmARUNUJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsM4lJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6775&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/766F86585B69F8A63FE4350B5695D2FB/D053C649/68CBD\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nmNWiMzGaU4CanH7UiozlbL8WRLRlg4MmG4UzU4L4v8L7U0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyDMYyanky4Llr2MRLZL4-8nzN8UmG4MmlbLz7iLm7aU4AFMmrfoR7DLlWFL4LiM4A2gtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDM4vigtA8pULcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6775&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次讲座为同学们搭建了跨学科交流平台，帮助大家从法律维度重读经典，在文学作品中感悟传统法治文化，进一步提升了人文素养与思辨能力。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MNCW8nRUYUm9snHNQVoRf7oR7YLm7g8UzWfMzL8MNMVLNC0gihFp2hmCIa0n1y4MShRLkhRU4NiMz-snRGaU4UYM4rfolLbL8linRn7nmAFL8CYL8VknR6FM8CbLR9Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsM4lJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6775&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F35C0CC95527D00C4275A9C93E5D4DF8/3F23ABD7/7F908\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-Mm6WfoRCYo7MVoHlQfo77YnlU4M4CgYnzGsMmUiUNMfo7L0gihFp2hmCIa0nShkMYyPM1hRMR6fLmGbMNWVU4vPozUZMR-sMl7DMRTVU4AFU8V7nR94LRWFM4vboR-igtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDM4vigtA8pULcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6775&e=.jpg\"></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MmMWfoR67nRlYMH4Q2oz-PM4CsnllgiLR9sLlUZM8l4LmC0gihFp2hmCIa0UShRM1yin1yZo7lsU4lYMmfVM7-iL49YnzGsM4-anRNDoRMFMmUsL8Q7LRrFMm74MRlJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsM4lJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6775&e=.jpg"}